                                 ; ===#===
                                 
                                 ; === Notes LUT ===
                                 ; to play a sound, load the note index into a reg (r17), then using a LUT to get the correct value to put in ocr1a ? rather than too many branches
                                 ; store this LUT in the flash mem:
                                 ; 48 notes (idx 0 to 47)
                                 Note_Table:
